cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "quarto-study-flow"
abstract: >-
  A Quarto shortcode extension that renders CONSORT, STROBE, PRISMA 2020,
  TRIPOD+AI, and STARD participant-flow diagrams from structured YAML in
  the document frontmatter. Pure Lua, with inline SVG output for HTML and
  native TikZ output for LaTeX/PDF; no external rendering dependencies.
